flowchart TD
    A[SysAdmin Login<br/>/login?role=sysadmin] --> B{Auth Check}
    B -->|Valid| C[SysAdmin Dashboard: /sysadmin]
    B -->|Invalid| A

    C --> D{SysAdmin Control Center Tabs}

    %% Sessions & Security Flow
    D -->|Click Sessions Tab| E1[Active Sessions<br/>/sysadmin/sessions]
    E1 --> F1[Load Session List<br/>GET /api/system/sessions]
    F1 --> G1[Session Cards<br/>User, IP, Last Active, Device]
    G1 --> H1{Click Session}
    H1 --> I1[Session Detail Modal]
    I1 --> J1{Revoke Actions}
    J1 -->|Revoke Single| K1[POST /api/system/sessions/:id/revoke]
    J1 -->|Revoke All Others| K2[POST /api/system/sessions/revoke-others]
    J1 -->|Force Logout| K3[POST /api/system/sessions/:id/kill]

    %% RBAC Roles Flow
    D -->|Click Roles Tab| E2[Roles & Permissions<br/>/sysadmin/roles]
    E2 --> F2[Load Role Matrix<br/>GET /api/system/roles]
    F2 --> G2[Role Cards Grid]
    G2 --> H2[Click Role Card]
    H2 --> I2[Role Detail Editor]
    I2 --> J2[Edit Permissions Checkboxes]
    J2 --> K4[Click Save -> POST /api/system/roles/:id]
    K4 --> L1[Role Updated Toast]

    E2 --> H3[Click "Add New Role"]
    H3 --> I3[Role Creation Form]
    I3 --> J3[Enter Role Name, Description]
    J3 --> K5[Define Permissions Matrix]
    K5 --> L2[POST /api/system/roles/create]

    %% SSO & Identity Flow
    D -->|Click SSO Tab| E3[SSO Configuration<br/>/sysadmin/sso]
    E3 --> F3[SSO Provider Cards<br/>Google, SAML, LDAP, OAuth]
    F3 --> G3{Configure Provider}
    G3 -->|Google Workspace| H4[OAuth Flow Setup<br/>Client ID, Secret]
    G3 -->|SAML| H5[SAML Metadata Upload<br/>IdP Certificate]
    G3 -->|LDAP| H6[LDAP Server Config<br/>Host, Port, Base DN]
    
    H4 --> I4[Click Test Connection]
    I4 --> J4[Verify Connection -> Success/Fail Alert]
    J4 --> K6[Enable Provider Toggle]

    %% Integrations Flow
    D -->|Click Integrations Tab| E4[Third-Party Integrations<br/>/sysadmin/integrations]
    E4 --> F4[Integration Cards<br/>ERP, LMS, RFID, Attendance]
    F4 --> G4{Configure Integration}
    G4 -->|ERP Sync| H5[ERP Config Modal<br/>API Endpoint, Auth Token]
    G4 -->|RFID Gateways| H6[RFID Controller Setup<br/>IP, Port, Protocol]
    G4 -->|Webhooks| H7[Webhook URL List<br/>Add/Edit/Delete URLs]
    
    H5 --> I5[Click "Test Sync" -> POST /api/integrations/erp/test]
    I5 --> J5[Sync Result Preview]
    J5 --> K7[Click "Run Full Sync"]

    %% Cron Jobs Flow
    D -->|Click Jobs Tab| E5[Background Jobs<br/>/sysadmin/jobs]
    E5 --> F5[Job List<br/>Nightly Sync, Cleanup, Reports]
    F5 --> G5[Click Job Card]
    G5 --> H6[Job Detail: Schedule, Last Run, Next Run]
    H6 --> I6{Job Actions}
    I6 -->|Run Now| J6[POST /api/cron/:jobId/trigger]
    I6 -->|Edit Schedule| J7[Cron Expression Editor]
    I6 -->|View Logs| J8[Job Execution Logs Modal]

    %% Audit Logs Flow
    D -->|Click Audit Tab| E6[System Audit Trail<br/>/sysadmin/audit]
    E6 --> F6[Load Audit Logs<br/>GET /api/system/audit]
    F6 --> G6[Filter Bar<br/>User, Action, Date Range]
    G6 --> H7[Log Table View]
    H7 --> I7{Click Log Row}
    I7 --> J9[Log Detail Modal<br/>Full JSON Payload]

    %% Navigation Editor Flow
    D -->|Click Navigation Tab| E7[Navigation Editor<br/>/sysadmin/navigation]
    E7 --> F7[Drag & Drop Menu Builder]
    F7 --> G7[Add/Remove Menu Items]
    G7 --> H8[Set Role Permissions per Item]
    H8 --> I8[Click Save -> POST /api/system/navigation]

    %% Academic Scheduling Flow
    D -->|Click Scheduling Tab| E8[Academic Calendar<br/>/sysadmin/scheduling]
    E8 --> F8[Calendar View<br/>Events, Holidays, Exams]
    F8 --> G8[Add Event Button]
    G8 --> H9[Event Form<br/>Name, Date, Type, Recurrence]
    H9 --> I9[Save Event -> POST /api/system/events]

    %% Department Master Flow
    D -->|Click Departments Tab| E9[Department Master<br/>/sysadmin/departments]
    E9 --> F9[Department List]
    F9 --> G9[Add/Edit Department]
    G9 --> H10[Form: Name, Code, HOD, Building]
    H10 --> I10[Save -> PATCH /api/system/departments]

    %% Student Promotions Flow
    D -->|Click Promotions Tab| E10[Batch Promotions<br/>/sysadmin/promotions]
    E10 --> F10[Promotion Config<br/>Select Current Year -> Target Year]
    F10 --> G10[Preview Student List]
    G10 --> H11[Click "Execute Promotion"]
    H11 --> I11[POST /api/system/students/promote]
    I11 --> J10[Success: Year Updated for All]

    %% Health & Telemetry Flow
    D -->|Click Health Tab| E11[System Health<br/>/sysadmin/health]
    E11 --> F11[Dashboard: DB, Cache, API Status]
    F11 --> G11[Metrics Cards<br/>CPU, Memory, Response Time]
    G11 --> H12[Click "View Details"]
    H12 --> I12[Detailed Metrics Modal<br/>Graphs, Logs]

    %% Logout Flow
    C --> X[Profile -> Logout]
    X --> Y[POST /api/auth/logout]
    Y --> Z[Clear Session]
    Z --> A